{% set order_url = include('order_url.twig')|trim %}
<p>We have reviewed the documents for order <strong>#{{ order.id }}</strong> and could <strong>NOT</strong> accept {% if type|default('') == 'id' %}your proof of identity{% elseif type|default('') == 'entitlement' %}your proof of entitlement{% else %}one of your documents{% endif %}{% if registration|default('') %} for <strong>{{ registration }}</strong>{% endif %}.</p>

<div class="alert">
  <p><strong>RE-UPLOAD</strong></p>
  <p>Please use the secure link below to upload a replacement:</p>
  <p><a href="{{ order_url|escape('html') }}">{{ order_url|escape('html') }}</a></p>
  <p>Please make sure the replacement is clear, legible and shows the whole document, with all details visible.</p>
</div>

<p>We cannot manufacture your number plates until all required documents have been received and approved.</p>
<p>Thank you for your help.</p>
